        "original_id": "df5b7faa-bf09-512a-a06a-8f9072381554",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charlie Ross, Gregg Harper\n- Roles: Mississippi state senator, Rankin County Republican Chairman, U.S. Representative\n- Places: Mississippi's 3rd congressional district, Rankin County, Mississippi\n- Events: 2008 congressional primary, 2009 start of congressional service\n\nFacts:\n- In 2008, Charlie Ross ran for Congress in Mississippi's 3rd congressional district.\n- In 2008, Gregg Harper, the Rankin County Republican Chairman, defeated Charlie Ross in the Republican primary for Mississippi's 3rd congressional district.\n- Gregory Livingston Harper was born on June 1, 1956.\n- Gregg Harper has served as the U.S. Representative for Mississippi's 3rd congressional district since 2009.",
